<Base>
  <p class="lede">
    Hi, I'm <strong>Nugraha</strong>. I spend most of my time inside Linux
    terminals, taking systems apart to understand how they break and how to
    secure them.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    Over the past year, I've worked through more than 260 hands-on labs across
    HackMyVM, DockerLabs, and VulNyx. After spending enough hours breaking into
    machines built by others, I started designing and publishing vulnerable
    machines of my own for the community to practice on. Four of them are live
    now: Groups on VulNyx, Ledger and Grenade on HackMyVM, and Hannah Coffee on
    DockerLabs.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    The tools I build along the way are small and self-contained, usually because
    I got tired of repeating the same steps by hand. Shellcraft, Ledger, and the
    three platform consoles are all on{" "}
    <a class="ep" href="/projects">the projects page</a>,
    newest first.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    I keep a record of what shipped and when, both software and lab machines,
    on{" "}
    <a class="ep" href="/milestones">the milestones page</a>.
    Each entry links back to the repository or platform that produced it.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    Whenever I finish an interesting box, I write the full walkthrough and host it
    here. All 304 of them are readable on{" "}
    <a class="ep" href="/writing">the writing page</a>,
    without an account or a download.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    I'm based in Semarang and currently in my fifth semester of Computer
    Engineering Technology at <a href="https://polines.ac.id/id" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Semarang State Polytechnic</a>. For 2026, I'm looking for an IT or security
    internship where I can work on real systems and learn from experienced
    engineers.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">
    If any of that is useful, reach me by{" "}
    <a href="mailto:pandu4688@gmail.com">email</a>,{" "}
    <a href="https://github.com/setyanoegraha" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>,
    or{" "}
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/setyanoegraha/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
